; A ring of small stones set round a single antler (WR-spec1-12): the herd trail's third stake. Pure decor;
; the stake that carries the interactable stands beside it. Twelve pebbles at 0.85 m, half the size the
; vendored pebble ships at, so they read as stones a hand set down rather than boulders.

